Right now click here for my Bonus Video on
the history of Meereen and Slaver’s Bay

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:43.170
and click here for my review of the episode.

00:09:43.170 --> 00:09:45.460
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

